{{!
    @template paygw_mercadopago/confirm_cycle

    Confirmar um ciclo de cartao com o CVV - o cartao ja esta guardado, so
    falta o codigo de seguranca. O campo e um Secure Field do Mercado Pago
    (mp-field-cvv), montado por card_form.js/initConfirmCycle - o CVV nunca
    chega a este HTML como valor, so o token que a tokenizacao produz.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region=mp-card-form

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formaction string
    * sesskey string
    * amount string
    * cancelurl string

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formaction": "https://exemplo.test/payment/gateway/mercadopago/confirm_cycle.php?ref=mdlsub-1-2-abc",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "amount": "R$ 49,90",
        "cancelurl": "https://exemplo.test/local/marketplace/mysubscriptions.php"
    }
}}
<div class="paygw-mercadopago-confirm-cycle">
    <p class="lead">{{#str}} confirmcycleamount, paygw_mercadopago, {{amount}} {{/str}}</p>
    <p class="text-muted small">{{#str}} confirmcycleexplain, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</p>

    <form method="post" action="{{formaction}}" data-region="mp-card-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="cardtoken" value="">

        <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-4">
                <label for="mp-field-cvv" class="form-label">{{#str}} cardsecuritycode, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                <div id="mp-field-cvv" class="form-control"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="mp-pay">
                {{#str}} subscribeconfirm, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>

    <p class="mt-3"><a href="{{cancelurl}}">{{#str}} confirmcyclecancel, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</a></p>
</div>
